! Malkauns.scl
!
Malkauns in F - Nadi (just intonation). Deep and meditative midnight pentatonic: Sa, komal Ga, Ma, komal Dha, komal Ni.
!
 5
!
 6/5
 4/3
 8/5
 9/5
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   ga    315.64 cents
!   Ma    498.04 cents
!   dha   813.69 cents
!   ni   1017.60 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
! Sattvagenic - sattvagenic.com/nadi
! Intended root: F3 = 349.2282 Hz — set your synth's base/root note to F.
